    "detailed_description": "Follow me in twitter for news: <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250160/extras/dfb0128412e6c66540b7e2fd3a3b70b0.avif?t=1669893481\" /></div><br><br><strong>Description;</strong><br><br>\u2023\u200a Strategy and planning are the keys when playing <strong>Spellbind Tactics</strong>, each character has certain set of movements that when used properly can lead to a powerful game plan, every character is designed to support each other in order to achieve effective synergies and movements. Your capacity when executing your game plan and your ability to react to your oponent's will be decisive in order to win.<br><br><strong>About the game:</strong><br><br>\u2023\u200aMultiplayer tactics based.<br>\u2023\u200aOne vs One onlie matchups.<br>\u2023\u200aBased on skills and decisions.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250160/extras/7dd5d86477b0cf68ed1b286e4e474bb0.avif?t=1669893481\" /></div><br>\u2023\u200a Each character has a unique set of abilities, choose wisely how to combine them!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250160/extras/afbff42bc7098b67504c2e9b0391cf0e.poster.avif?t=1669893481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250160/extras/afbff42bc7098b67504c2e9b0391cf0e.webm?t=1669893481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250160/extras/afbff42bc7098b67504c2e9b0391cf0e.mp4?t=1669893481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250160/extras/e3da928ef6ab1db9bff821072cccd9ad.avif?t=1669893481\" /></div><br>\u2023\u200a Plan your attack and your defense, adapt to the moves of your opponent!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250160/extras/24edbc9de98c23b0c0fac18b38a331cc.poster.avif?t=1669893481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250160/extras/24edbc9de98c23b0c0fac18b38a331cc.webm?t=1669893481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250160/extras/24edbc9de98c23b0c0fac18b38a331cc.mp4?t=1669893481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250160/extras/50b3801bdcb55665408469e5c4e4a967.avif?t=1669893481\" /></div><br>\u2023\u200a Combine different characters and abilities to unlock powerful effects!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250160/extras/26056a36b9574cfe30f1817c86d151db.poster.avif?t=1669893481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250160/extras/26056a36b9574cfe30f1817c86d151db.webm?t=1669893481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1250160/extras/26056a36b9574cfe30f1817c86d151db.mp4?t=1669893481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
